## 1.4 Evaluation of CKD: albuminuria
- 1.4.4.1: We suggest using the following measurements for initial testing of proteinuria (in descending order of preference, in all cases an early morning urine sample is preferred) ( 2B ):
- 1) urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio (ACR);
- 2) urine protein-to-creatinine ratio (PCR);
- 3) reagent strip urinalysis for total protein with automated reading;
- 4) reagent strip urinalysis for total protein with manual reading.

